    "body": "I agree that we should update the spec to not process the string at all. If the majority of browsers agree that omitting the string is a security fix, the spec should not suggest an insecure path. I can work on a patch for this next week (although PRs are welcome in the meantime).\n\n/cc @travisleithead @DigiTec as an FYI, since this would make Edge have non-standard behavior.\n",
